llo everyone,</p>
            <p>This week, the global AI and financial sectors witnessed a pro=
found shift from speculative hype to rigorous financial validation. As instit=
utional investors reallocate capital toward physical infrastructure, major fi=
nancial institutions like Goldman Sachs and Bank of America are launching mul=
ti-billion-dollar financing frameworks to support AI data centers and power g=
rids. Concurrently, the rise of autonomous AI agents has triggered both regul=
atory scrutiny from the US Congress and sophisticated cyber threats, forcing =
financial institutions to rapidly upgrade their security postures.</p>
